-        *   Apply vertex data to `opaqueMesh`.
-        *   If `positions.length > 0`, set `noVoxels = false` and restore `isVisible` from `oldVisibility`.
+        *   Apply vertex data to `this.mesh`.
+        *   If `vertexData.positions.length > 0`:
+            *   Set `this.mesh.noVoxels = false`.
+            *   Restore `this.mesh.isVisible` from `oldVisibility`.
